    kpi_pico: "Most critical day", kpi_pico_sub: (i, p) => `${i === 0 ? "Today" : i === 1 ? "Tomorrow" : `In ${i} days`}${p ? ` · ${p} at high risk` : ""}`, kpi_ayuda_pico: "Day of the next two weeks with the most people in high or very high risk municipalities (with a circle, the day of highest risk). Based on ECMWF rainfall forecasts, rivers (GloFAS and INA) and SMN warnings.",
