    prev_quebrada: "Don't build or park in dry riverbeds or fords, and know the shortest way to higher ground.",
    prev_tiempo: (d) => `There is time until ${d}, the most critical day: clear ditches and drains, check roofs and gutters, and make a family plan.`,
